    <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>5</b> Ask about an expected room plan before requesting the room.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>Will you be using the room at 3:00?</strong></p></div>
